comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-06T17:06:49.586Z",codex-root,Only this actively executed delivery plan is in progress; the product feature stays open until implementation proof exists.
  "2026-08-06T18:16:30.976Z",codex-root,"CodeRabbit identified duplicate roadmap numbering in docs/LLM_INTEGRATION.md; verified as valid and corrected 16/17 to 17/18. Its separate docstring heuristic warning is contradicted by the repository-owned 131/131 source docstring gate. CodeRabbit and Sourcery full-review providers reported quota limits, which are recorded as limitations rather than approvals."
  "2026-08-07T05:16:53.402Z",codex-root,"Latest PM integrity validation found the merge-fence additions required by pm-cli 2026.8.6; pm merge install applied them. Built-in plan show also emitted a stale pm close next action for this already closed 100%-complete plan. Detailed duplicate searches found no report, so upstream pm-cli issue #924 was filed."
  "2026-08-07T05:21:21.494Z",codex-root,"Correction: the global pm executable is backed by a local pm-cli development checkout and proposed two unreleased merge-fence lines. The canonical published @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.8.6 installer used by release:verify restored the released fence and passed PM validation. Issue #924 was separately reproduced with the published package and remains valid."
notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-06T17:06:49.586Z",codex-root,Use blocking waits for long tests and review agents; take one final exact-head inventory after checks settle.
  "2026-08-06T17:48:46.196Z",codex-root,Auto-release dry-run was intentionally non-publishing and reported pushed=false. A temporary-workspace PM health snapshot observed a pending telemetry queue warning while all integrity checks passed; production release verification reported healthy PM state.
learnings[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-06T17:06:49.586Z",codex-root,"Meaningful graph depth comes from parent, plan-step, provenance, verification, and quality lineage rather than arbitrary edge multiplication."
  "2026-08-07T05:16:53.402Z",codex-root,Run pm merge install after PM CLI upgrades when storage-integrity reports merge-fence drift; package-managed extensions need an explicit -merge fence plus the managed-extension registry needs key-level JSON merging.
  "2026-08-07T05:21:21.494Z",codex-root,"When a global pm executable is linked to a development checkout, use bunx @unbrained/pm-cli@latest for canonical release evidence and distinguish unreleased local diagnostics from published behavior."
