plan_scope: "Stable Home Assistant WebSocket automation runtime contracts plus synchronized agent, schema, help, wizard, quality, and delivery evidence."
plan_harness: codex
plan_resume_context: "Continue on agent/typed-automation-runtime. Official stable 2026.8.0 and live 2026.7.4 contracts are confirmed. Keep secrets outside Git, preserve exact coverage, and finish through PR reviews, checks, merge, and clean master without release publication."
plan_validation[3]{text,command,expected}:
  Official/latest and live compatibility contract established,Home Assistant 2026.8.0 source schema inspection plus read-only hassio ws calls,"test_condition, subscribe_condition, and execute_script inputs/results match current source"
  Strict release and automatic daily release gates passed,"bun run release:verify && bun run release:auto:dry-run","Exact coverage, security, PM/changelog, build/tests, and packed npx/bunx consumers pass; dry-run reports pushed=false"
  Exact-head hosted delivery and merge proof,gh pr checks 87 --watch; gh pr view 87; gh pr merge 87 --squash --delete-branch,"All required checks pass, merge state is CLEAN, PR is merged, and master matches origin/master"
plan_decisions[1]{ts,author,decision,rationale,evidence}:
  "2026-08-06T17:07:50.162Z",codex-root,"Expose one cohesive ws automation-runtime group with test-condition, observe-condition, and execute-sequence subcommands while retaining raw ws call.",These commands share JSON/file/variables inputs and form one discovery-to-validation-to-runtime agent workflow; grouping avoids top-level command sprawl.,Home Assistant Core 2026.8.0 commands.py schemas and existing CLI ws validate-config/subscribe-trigger patterns.
plan_discoveries[3]{ts,author,text}:
  "2026-08-06T17:07:50.662Z",codex-root,"Local Home Assistant 2026.7.4 supports the same three stable WebSocket command schemas as upstream 2026.8.0; live evidence will record only version and contract success, never private payloads."
  "2026-08-06T18:16:30.476Z",codex-root,"During the hosted review wait, protected master advanced to the sole immutable daily release v2026.8.6. The branch was merged forward with the PM JSON driver; the only conflict was generated updated_at ordering, and the latest extension installer normalized it."
  "2026-08-07T05:14:32.295Z",codex-root,"The GitHub Actions incident canceled queued jobs before runner allocation. Rerunning workflow_dispatch proved the same SHA but did not satisfy PR branch-protection contexts; closing and immediately reopening PR #87 safely retriggered the lost pull_request event, after which all required checks passed."
